{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "id": "01-unresolved-symbol",
  "title": "Unresolved symbol: the path runs through an unrooted `local 3` callee",
  "rule_pack": "rules-static-v1",
  "provenance": {
    "kind": "synthetic",
    "source": "hand-authored adversarial static case",
    "seeded_fault": null
  },
  "context": {
    "index": "1ec9372293b1044c87c39e5a7647538d52cf4a5a0147b8eae322abfb4789b4e8"
  },
  "review_notes": [
    "scip-go emitted the closure GetJob calls as `local 3`; scip_symbol_unrooted records reason `local` and no scip_symbol_node row exists for it.",
    "Symbol-level rules do not need node identity: static_edge(H, local 3) and static_edge(local 3, Repo#Get) close static_reaches, so static_capability is supported.",
    "The node-level claim asks for scip_symbol_node(index, local 3, ?); no fact matches, so it is unresolved with the missing premise scip_symbol_node and the discrepancy unrooted-symbol."
  ],
